<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>EMBEDDING</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 14 }}>Embedding：文字变向量，机器才懂意思相近</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 20 }} />

    <Box style={{ background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 24px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, marginBottom: 22 }}>
      <FAIcon name='cube' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        把文字映射成高维空间里的一个「点」——<span style={{ color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>意思越近，向量距离越近</span>。「猫」和「狗」靠得近，「猫」和「汽车」离得远。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, flex: 1 }}>
      {[
        { t: '语义搜索', d: '用户搜「怎么快速入睡」，能命中「失眠怎么办」——搜的是意思，不是字面。', icon: 'search' },
        { t: '推荐系统', d: '「相似内容」推荐、相关文章、猜你喜欢，本质都是向量最近邻。', icon: 'thumbs-up' },
        { t: 'RAG 基石', d: '知识库召回靠的就是 Embedding：把问题向量化，再找最相关的资料片段。', icon: 'layer-group' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '26px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, borderRadius: 12, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
              <FAIcon name={item.icon} style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>{item.t}</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>{item.d}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 1 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>06 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
